      "value": "Im doing a Mega Canny with all the people request make sure to vote this compilation of Ideas and maybe we are lucky after all this time\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/feature-loading-screen-needs-to-change-have-an-use-mega-canny-compilation\nMaybe after all this time",
