  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Besides the game tips & tricks they already have in the loading screen I would like to suggest to add small advertisement of inner VRChat communities (#community-servers in the official VRChat Discord) into the loading screen too.\n\nIn my opinion a lot of people have trouble connecting with other people especially when they are new. I'm the founder of the VRChat Party Community and from my experience I can tell its way easier for people to get involved and become happier if they join an inner community in this game. I also believe this would be very sustainable and would decrease the amount of people who will just leave because they did not find any long term social interactions.\n\n\nRegards\nSPOONPAI",
